<!-- ════ PROBLEM ════ -->
<section id="problem">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="eyebrow">01 · The Problem</div>
    <h2>Three systems. Partial linkage. No complete picture.</h2>
    <p>Payments controls data lived across JUNO, Holocentric, and Alfabet. A deterministic linkage existed between Holocentric and JUNO, but only at the L3 activity level. L2 process linkage was not possible because of a missing UUID, leaving a significant portion of controls without a process anchor.</p>

    <!-- animated constellation -->
    <div id="constellation-wrap" style="height:300px; position:relative; border:1px solid var(--border); border-radius:10px; overflow:hidden; margin-top:32px; background:var(--bg2);">
      <canvas id="constellation" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;"></canvas>
    </div>

    <div class="card-row" style="margin-top:20px">
      <div class="card">
        <div style="font-size:1.8rem;margin-bottom:6px">708</div>
        <h3>Payments controls</h3>
        <p>Across 75 products and 28 control objective groups described entirely in natural language.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div style="font-size:1.4rem;margin-bottom:6px">L3 only</div>
        <h3>Process linkage</h3>
        <p>The Holocentric to JUNO linkage was deterministic but capped at L3 activity level. Controls without a Holocentric linkage were excluded or evaluated manually.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div style="font-size:1.8rem;margin-bottom:6px">3</div>
        <h3>Source systems</h3>
        <p>JUNO (control register, nature data), Holocentric (process models), and Alfabet (application architecture). No shared key across all three.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ════ APPROACH ════ -->
<section id="approach">
  <div class="inner">
    <div class="eyebrow">02 · Our Approach</div>
    <h2>Five steps. One pipeline.</h2>
    <p>Each stage built on the last, from raw data consolidation through to structured recommendations.</p>

    <div class="pipeline" id="pipeline">
      <div class="pl-step">
        <div class="pl-left"><div class="pl-num">01</div><div class="pl-line"></div></div>
