          <div class="codeblock">PROMPT_VERSION = "2026-08-20-nature-gated-v1"

# Resume: records without current version → regenerated
# Connection error → sleep(90) → new AzureOpenAI()
# API error → exponential backoff on same client</div>
        </div>
